      "blurb": "Non-Elemental: Beast Imitating Art: Oni Twins (A-Rank)",
      "summonRole": "Ink Oni",
      "biography": "<p><em>Beast Imitating Art: Oni Twins (A-Rank) (Non-Elemental Ninjutsu).</em> It uses your Ninjutsu attack bonus and save DC. You command it as a Bonus Action; it can take reactions it's able to, such as opportunity attacks.</p><p><strong>Large Construct.</strong> <strong>Armor Class</strong> 16 + 2 for every rank above B-Rank, DR 6 · <strong>Hit Points</strong> 40 + 15 for every rank above B-Rank · <strong>Speed</strong> 45 ft..</p><p><strong>Abilities</strong> STR +7 (save +7), DEX +2 (save +1), CON +6 (save +6), INT −5 (save −5), WIS +0 (save +0), CHA −5 (save −5). <strong>Condition Immunities</strong> Charmed, Chilled, Exhaustion, Stunned, Envenomed. <strong>Senses</strong> Darkvision 30 ft., passive Perception 10.</p><p><strong>Linked to you when summoned:</strong> AC and hit points by the rank you cast the jutsu at, and your Ninjutsu attack bonus and save DC.</p>"
